      "text": ".@elonmusk on Ben Franklin:\n\n\"Franklin's pretty awesome.\"\n\n\"He was an entrepreneur. He started from nothing, and was actually just a runaway kid basically. And created his printing business, and sort of how he went about doing that, and then over time he also did science and politics.\"\n\n\"He's certainly one of the people I most admire.\"\n\nVia @kevinrose",
